  "description": "Connects the OASIS to MultiversX (formerly Elrond) -- adaptive state sharding blockchain achieving 15,000+ TPS with 6-second finality via Secure Proof of Stake. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and ESDT tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
